    "Compare geocentric and heliocentric explanations for retrograde motion and justify why the heliocentric model is more parsimonious.",
    "Predict when retrograde motion will occur for an outer planet based on relative orbital positions and speeds.",
    "Compare the retrograde loops of Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn and explain why more distant planets show smaller apparent loops."
